furiusisomount (0.11.3.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian release.
  * Modular PyQt6 rewrite of Furius ISO Mount with a multi-language interface
    (Qt Linguist): English, Spanish, French, Portuguese, German, Italian,
    Japanese, Russian and Chinese Simplified.
  * Add man page, AppStream metadata and an autopkgtest smoke test.

